{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2022-08-08 09:15:00', 'title': 'ILLUMINA GENOMICS FORUM TO FEATURE BILL GATES AND DISTINGUISHED HEALTH LEADERS ADDRESSING NEED FOR GLOBAL ACCESS TO GENOMICS', 'text': 'SPEAKERS WILL OUTLINE CRITICAL STEPS NEEDED TO ACHIEVE HEALTH EQUITY SAN DIEGO , AUG. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ: ILMN), A GLOBAL LEADER IN DNA SEQUENCING AND ARRAY-BASED TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ON SEPTEMBER 30, ITS ILLUMINA GENOMICS FORUM (IGF) WILL FEATURE BILL GATES, CO-CHAIR OF THE BILL & MELINDA GATES FOUNDATION, WHO WILL DELIVER A KEYNOTE ADDRESS ON THE REMARKABLE POTENTIAL OF GENOMICS TO CHANGE THE TRAJECTORY OF GLOBAL HEALTH. IN ADDITION, IGF WILL HOST A PANEL SESSION TITLED "MAKING \'GENOMICS FOR ALL\' MORE THAN A MANTRA," ON THE REQUIREMENTS NEEDED TO ENSURE BROADER ACCESS TO GENOMIC HEALTH.'}